{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790963400, "covers_from": "2026-10-02T17:50:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-02T17:51:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790963460, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-02T17:50:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 30850, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "改善公車駕駛習慣，建立靠站停妥後乘客再下車制度。不然公車暴走，交通險象環生 乘客站不穩容易跌倒", "display_name": "大安代表 Travis Su", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-02T17:50:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 40328, "sprite_key": "turtle_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "食安", "content": "學生不要再吃到有問題營養午餐", "display_name": "大同代表 Eric", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-02T17:50:20+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 49349, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "如果台北市的每一顆樹都編碼，開放市民記名認養，這樣整體綠化就不僅僅是公務單位照表操課，大家一起關心。", "display_name": "大安代表 No.49,349", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-02T17:50:35+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 267, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "交通", "content": "內湖交通太塞了，每天都花好多時間在通勤塞車，真的好累", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.267", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-02T17:50:44+00:00", "duration_seconds": 16, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 24882, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "交通", "content": "早上六點要搭機捷，我先到臺北車站，卻發現那一帶的電梯幾乎不能使用，只能扛著行李走下樓，這有辦法改善嗎", "display_name": "中正代表 No.24,882", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 40328, "sprite_key": "turtle_oldtown", "display_name": "大同代表 Eric", "district": "datong", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 49349, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.49,349", "district": "daan", "is_replay": t